  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.Rajan vs The District Collector on 19 January, 2024 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 19.01.2024 Coram The Honourable Ms.Justice R.N.Manjula W.P. No.12183 of 2021 K.Rajan ... Vs. 1. The District Collector, Krishnagiri, Krishnagiri District. 2. The Special Tahsildar, Food safety and Consumer Protection Department, Krishnagiri, Krishnagiri. . Writ Petition is filed under Article 226 of the Consti issue a Writ of Mandamus, directing the 2nd respondent to consider pass orders on the petitioner's representation, dated 13.08.2012 wi to regularization and payment of arrears of salary from January 200 For Petitioner : Mr.R.K.Gandhi For Respondents : Mr.R.Neethi Perumal, Government Advocate Page 1 of 4 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ORDER The petitioner is working as a daily wage driver in the 2nd respondent Office since July 2007. According to the petitioner, he is eligible to be appointed as a regular driver. However, his services were not regularised. In this regard, the petitioner made a representation, dated 13.08.2012, K.Rajan vs The District Collector on 19 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/47821313/ 1 claiming regularization of his services and to pay the wages due to him. But the same was not considered.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
